### What this PR does?
- Upgrade linters versions in `pre-commit`;
- Replace `pyupgrade`, `black`, `pyupgrade`, `isort` with `ruff`;
- Remove linters from `dev` deps to use only `pre-commit` and not duplicate requirements;

### What this PR does in details?
- Lint all files, not just `pixivpy3` to have all files valid;
- Make `ruff` select `ALL` to enable all rules but `ignored` (by this enabling `isort` and other linters);
- To fix annotation errors, fix & add typehints;
- Add all not yet handled rules to `pyproject.toml`: `[tool.ruff.lint]`;

### How was this tested?
- `precommit run --all-files`;
- I run some code with `pixivpy3` to ensure everything works;
